(# Tatum Voice AI Call Center Cost Estimator) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (An interactive calculator for estimating the cost of deploying Tatum Voice AI Answering Service based on call volume and) Tj
T* (business requirements.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Overview) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This calculator helps businesses determine the potential cost and savings of implementing Tatum Voice AI Answering) Tj
T* (Service. It takes into account various factors such as missed call volume, call length, and business size to provide accurate) Tj
T* (cost estimates.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Features) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- Interactive sliders and input fields for easy data entry) Tj
T* (- Real-time calculation updates) Tj
T* (- Cost breakdown showing detailed expense categories) Tj
T* (- Savings analysis comparing current costs to Tatum Voice AI costs) Tj
T* (- Visual comparison chart) Tj
T* (- Responsive design for all device sizes) Tj
T* (- Print functionality for saving or sharing results) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Files Included) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- `index.html` - The main HTML structure of the calculator) Tj
T* (- `styles.css` - CSS styling with Tatum branding colors \(#34bcdc and #0e0037\)) Tj
T* (- `script.js` - JavaScript functionality for calculations and interactivity) Tj
T* (- `manual_test_cases.json` - Test cases with expected results for verification) Tj
T* (- `calculation_logic.json` - Extracted calculation parameters from the original Excel worksheet) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Installation Instructions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Option 1: Direct Website Integration) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Upload all files to your web server) Tj
T* (2. Include the calculator in your website by linking to the uploaded files) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
