() Tj
T* (```html) Tj
T* (<!-- Add to your website's HTML where you want the calculator to appear -->) Tj
T* (<iframe src="path/to/calculator/index.html" width="100%" height="800px" frameborder="0"></iframe>) Tj
T* (```) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Option 2: Embed Directly in Existing Page) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Copy the HTML from `index.html` into your webpage where you want the calculator to appear) Tj
T* (2. Add the CSS by either:) Tj
T* (   - Copying the content of `styles.css` into your existing stylesheet) Tj
T* (   - Adding a link to the stylesheet in your HTML header:) Tj
T* (     ```html) Tj
T* (     <link rel="stylesheet" href="path/to/styles.css">) Tj
T* (     ```) Tj
T* (3. Add the JavaScript by either:) Tj
T* (   - Copying the content of `script.js` into your existing JavaScript file) Tj
T* (   - Adding a script tag at the end of your HTML body:) Tj
T* (     ```html) Tj
T* (     <script src="path/to/script.js"></script>) Tj
T* (     ```) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Customization) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Changing Colors) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The calculator uses two main brand colors that can be easily modified in the CSS file:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- Primary color \(Light Blue\): `#34bcdc`) Tj
T* (- Secondary color \(Dark Purple\): `#0e0037`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (To change these colors, edit the corresponding values in `styles.css`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Modifying Calculation Parameters) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (If the pricing structure changes, you can update the constants in the JavaScript file:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Open `script.js`) Tj
T* (2. Locate the `CONSTANTS` object at the top of the file) Tj
T* (3. Update the values as needed) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (```javascript) Tj
T* (const CONSTANTS = {) Tj
T* (    LC_PHONE_PER_MIN: 0.0085,) Tj
T* (    AI_PHONE_PER_MIN: 0.13,) Tj
T* (    // other parameters...) Tj
T* (};) Tj
T* (```) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Browser Compatibility) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The calculator is compatible with all modern browsers:) Tj
T* (- Chrome) Tj
T* (- Firefox) Tj
T* (- Safari) Tj
T* (- Edge) Tj
ET
endstream
