T* (guidance, and comprehensive warranty coverage. Used vehicles start from $12,999, new vehicles from $24,999, certified) Tj
T* (pre-owned from $18,999, with financing from 2.9% APR. This is ideal for car buyers, families needing reliable transportation,) Tj
T* (or anyone seeking quality vehicles with financing assistance.") Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Automotive Service & Maintenance:** "We maintain vehicle performance and reliability with expert) Tj
T* (service and genuine parts. Oil changes start from $39.99, brake service from $199, tire installation from $89, and major) Tj
T* (repairs from $299. This is perfect for vehicle owners needing maintenance, repair services, or anyone wanting to keep their) Tj
T* (car in optimal condition.") Tj
T* () Tj
