T* (A: "Yes, we provide complimentary vehicle consultations and trade-in appraisals for all potential customers. This includes) Tj
T* (assessing your needs, reviewing available inventory, and providing honest vehicle recommendations at no cost. Would you) Tj
T* (like me to schedule a free consultation for you?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What's your pricing?**) Tj
