T* () Tj
T* (**Exact Script to Use:**) Tj
T* ("We offer two primary services. First is **Custom Countertop Installation**, where we provide professional installation of) Tj
T* (granite, quartz, and marble countertops with precision templating and fabrication. Second is **Countertop Repair &) Tj
T* (Restoration**, where we handle professional countertop repair services including chip repair, polishing, and sealing.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Are you interested in learning more about one of these, or did you have something else in mind?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Detailed Information \(Provide only if the caller asks for more details on a specific service\):**) Tj
