T* (warranty. Countertop installation starts at $45 per sq ft with complete kitchens from $2,800. This is ideal for kitchen and) Tj
T* (bathroom renovations requiring durable, beautiful countertop surfaces.") Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Countertop Repair & Restoration:** "We restore appearance, extend life, and provide cost-effective) Tj
T* (solutions. Countertop repairs start from $150 and restoration services from $350. This is perfect for properties with damaged) Tj
T* (countertops that can be restored instead of replaced.") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### **Frequently Asked Questions**) Tj
T* () Tj
