T* () Tj
T* (### **Products/Services \(Revised\)**) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**How to present our services:**) Tj
T* (When a caller asks what services you offer, you must follow this script exactly. The goal is to be brief and interactive. Do not) Tj
T* (list all details.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Exact Script to Use:**) Tj
T* ("We offer two primary services. First is **General Dentistry & Preventive Care**, where we provide comprehensive dental) Tj
T* (services including cleanings, exams, fillings, crowns, and preventive treatments for the whole family. Second is **Cosmetic) Tj
T* (Dentistry & Smile Makeovers**, where we handle advanced cosmetic treatments including teeth whitening, veneers,) Tj
T* (Invisalign, and complete smile transformations.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Are you interested in learning more about one of these, or did you have something else in mind?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Detailed Information \(Provide only if the caller asks for more details on a specific service\):**) Tj
T* (- **If they ask about General Dentistry & Preventive Care:** "We maintain optimal oral health and prevent costly dental) Tj
T* (problems. Cleanings start from $129, exams from $89, fillings from $149, and crowns from $899. This is ideal for families) Tj
T* (seeking routine dental care, preventive maintenance, or addressing dental issues.") Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Cosmetic Dentistry & Smile Makeovers:** "We enhance smile appearance and boost confidence with) Tj
T* (modern techniques. Teeth whitening starts from $399, veneers from $1,299 per tooth, and Invisalign from $3,999. This is) Tj
T* (perfect for patients wanting to improve their smile, special occasions, or professional appearance enhancement.") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### **Frequently Asked Questions**) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are our state-of-the-art technology, gentle sedation options, and our) Tj
T* (comprehensive approach to oral health. We also offer flexible payment plans and accept most insurance plans. Would you) Tj
T* (like me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**) Tj
T* (A: "Yes, we provide complimentary consultations for cosmetic treatments and second opinions. For routine care, we offer) Tj
T* (comprehensive new patient exams that include X-rays and cleaning at a special rate. Would you like me to schedule a) Tj
T* (consultation for you?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What's your pricing?**) Tj
T* (A: "Our pricing varies based on treatment needs and insurance coverage. Generally, cleanings start at $129, basic) Tj
T* (procedures range from $149 to $899, and cosmetic treatments begin at $399. We work with most insurance plans and offer) Tj
T* (payment plans. I'd be happy to schedule a consultation to discuss your specific needs and provide exact pricing.") Tj
T* () Tj
