T* (When a caller asks what services you offer, you must follow this script exactly. The goal is to be brief and interactive. Do not) Tj
T* (list all details.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Exact Script to Use:**) Tj
T* ("We offer two primary services. First is **Medical Dermatology & Skin Health**, where we provide comprehensive skin) Tj
T* (health services including skin cancer screenings, acne treatment, eczema management, and medical dermatology with) Tj
T* (board-certified dermatologists. Second is **Cosmetic Dermatology & Aesthetic Treatments**, where we handle advanced) Tj
T* (cosmetic treatments including Botox, dermal fillers, laser treatments, and anti-aging procedures with aesthetic specialists.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Are you interested in learning more about one of these, or did you have something else in mind?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Detailed Information \(Provide only if the caller asks for more details on a specific service\):**) Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Medical Dermatology & Skin Health:** "We maintain optimal skin health and treat skin conditions) Tj
T* (through expert medical dermatology and early detection. Skin consultations start from $249, acne treatments from $199,) Tj
T* (skin cancer screenings from $299, and medical treatments from $179. This is ideal for skin health concerns, acne sufferers,) Tj
T* (skin cancer prevention, or anyone needing professional dermatological care.") Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Cosmetic Dermatology & Aesthetic Treatments:** "We enhance appearance and reduce signs of aging) Tj
T* (through advanced cosmetic dermatology and non-surgical treatments. Botox starts from $399, dermal fillers from $599, laser) Tj
T* (treatments from $499, and anti-aging packages from $799. This is perfect for anti-aging goals, cosmetic enhancement, skin) Tj
T* (rejuvenation, or anyone wanting professional aesthetic treatments.") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### **Frequently Asked Questions**) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are our board-certified dermatologists with advanced training, state-of-the-art) Tj
T* (laser technology, and our comprehensive approach to skin health. We also offer same-day appointments and personalized) Tj
T* (treatment plans. Would you like me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**) Tj
T* (A: "Yes, we provide complimentary skin assessments and treatment consultations for all new patients. This includes skin) Tj
T* (analysis, treatment recommendations, and cost estimates at no cost. Would you like me to schedule a free consultation for) Tj
T* (you?") Tj
