T* (- **Business Hours:** Monday-Friday 9 AM - 5 PM EST) Tj
T* (- **Location:** 1678 Heavy Equipment Way, Oklahoma City, OK 73101) Tj
T* (- **Website:** www.digdeepexcavation.com) Tj
T* (- **Email:** service@digdeepexcavation.com) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### **Products/Services \(Revised\)**) Tj
T* () Tj
