T* (Are you interested in learning more about one of these, or did you have something else in mind?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Detailed Information \(Provide only if the caller asks for more details on a specific service\):**) Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Professional Excavation Services:** "We provide professional equipment, experienced operators, and) Tj
T* (safety compliance. Excavation starts at $125 per hour with project rates from $2,499. This is ideal for construction projects,) Tj
T* (foundation work, utility installation, or site preparation.") Tj
T* (- **If they ask about Land Clearing & Grading:** "We provide site preparation, proper drainage, and development-ready land.) Tj
T* (Land clearing starts from $1,899 and grading from $2,999. This is perfect for development projects, construction sites, or) Tj
T* (properties needing land preparation.") Tj
