T* (and health screenings) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Maintains optimal health and provides early detection of health issues) Tj
T* (- Price: Annual physicals from $199, office visits from $149, health screenings from $89) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Individuals and families seeking comprehensive healthcare, preventive care, or ongoing medical management) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (#### Specialized Medical Services) Tj
T* (- Description: Specialized care including women's health, men's health, geriatric care, and minor procedures with referral) Tj
T* (coordination) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Provides specialized expertise while maintaining continuity of care) Tj
T* (- Price: Specialized consultations from $249, minor procedures from $299, women's health exams from $179) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Patients needing specialized care, complex medical conditions, or coordinated treatment plans) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Frequently Asked Questions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are our board-certified physicians, same-day appointment availability, and) Tj
T* (comprehensive approach to family medicine. We also offer telemedicine consultations and accept most insurance plans.) Tj
