T* (- Description: Professional outdoor fireplace design and installation including stone, brick, and gas fireplaces with safety) Tj
T* (features) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Outdoor entertainment, property value increase, year-round outdoor use) Tj
T* (- Price: Outdoor fireplaces starting at $4,500, custom designs from $8,200) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Homeowners wanting outdoor entertainment spaces, property enhancement, or extended outdoor living seasons) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (#### Fireplace Repair & Maintenance) Tj
T* (- Description: Professional outdoor fireplace repair and maintenance services including chimney cleaning and safety) Tj
T* (inspections) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Safety assurance, extends fireplace life, prevents costly repairs) Tj
T* (- Price: Fireplace repairs from $285, maintenance services from $195) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Properties with existing outdoor fireplaces needing professional care and safety maintenance) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Frequently Asked Questions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are certified fireplace specialists with 17+ years experience, custom stone) Tj
T* (masonry work, and comprehensive safety certifications. Would you like me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**) Tj
T* (A: "Yes, we provide a complimentary outdoor space assessment with fireplace design concepts and detailed installation) Tj
T* (estimate. Would you like me to schedule one for you?") Tj
