T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are our artistic style with natural lighting expertise, 8+ years of professional) Tj
T* (experience, and our comprehensive packages including digital galleries and print options. We also offer flexible scheduling) Tj
T* (and location options. Would you like me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**) Tj
T* (A: "Yes, we provide complimentary consultation sessions for all potential clients to discuss your vision, review our portfolio,) Tj
T* (and plan your perfect photo session. This includes location scouting and styling advice at no cost. Would you like me to) Tj
T* (schedule a free consultation for you?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What's your pricing?**) Tj
T* (A: "Our pricing varies based on session type, duration, and package inclusions. Generally, portrait sessions start at $199,) Tj
T* (wedding packages begin at $1,899, and commercial photography ranges from $499 to $1,299 per session. All packages) Tj
T* (include professional editing and digital delivery. I'd be happy to discuss specific pricing for your photography needs and) Tj
T* (schedule a consultation.") Tj
