T* (- Business Hours: Monday-Friday 9 AM - 5 PM EST) Tj
T* (- Location: 3345 Poolside Boulevard, Tampa, FL 33601) Tj
T* (- Website: www.aquadeckpools.com) Tj
T* (- Email: service@aquadeckpools.com) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Products/Services) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (#### Custom Pool Deck Installation) Tj
T* (- Description: Complete pool deck installation including concrete, pavers, and natural stone options) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Slip-resistant surface, custom design, pool integration) Tj
T* (- Price: Pool deck installation starting at $12 per sq ft, complete decks from $4,999) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: New pools, deck replacement, or properties wanting enhanced pool areas) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (#### Pool Deck Repair & Resurfacing) Tj
T* (- Description: Professional pool deck repair and resurfacing services to restore existing decks) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: Safety restoration, improved appearance, extended deck life) Tj
T* (- Price: Repairs from $599, resurfacing from $1,299) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Properties with damaged decks, safety concerns, or aesthetic improvements) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Frequently Asked Questions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What makes you different from competitors?**) Tj
T* (A: "Great question! Our key differentiators are pool deck specialists with 15+ years experience, slip-resistant materials, and) Tj
T* (comprehensive pool integration. Would you like me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**) Tj
T* (A: "Yes, we provide a complimentary pool area assessment with deck recommendations and detailed installation estimate.) Tj
T* (Would you like me to schedule one for you?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What's your pricing?**) Tj
T* (A: "Our pricing varies based on deck size, material selection, and design complexity. Generally, our pool deck installation) Tj
T* (starts at $12 per square foot. I'd be happy to discuss which option would work best for your situation.") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Lead Qualification & Data Collection) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Information to Gather) Tj
T* (1. Full name: "May I have your full name, please?") Tj
T* (2. Email: "What's the best email address to reach you?") Tj
T* (3. Phone: "I have your number as [repeat number]. Is this the best number to reach you?") Tj
T* (4. Company \(if B2B\): "What company are you with?") Tj
T* (5. Specific needs: "What specific challenges are you looking to solve?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### If Reluctant to Share Information) Tj
T* ("I completely understand your privacy concerns. This information simply helps us provide you with the most relevant) Tj
T* (information and ensures we can follow up appropriately. We never share your information with third parties.") Tj
