T* (compassionate approach to pet care. We also offer 24/7 emergency services and flexible payment options. Would you like) Tj
T* (me to elaborate on any of these?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: Do you offer free consultations?**  ) Tj
T* (A: "We offer complimentary meet-and-greet visits for new clients to tour our facility and meet our veterinary team. For) Tj
T* (medical consultations, standard examination fees apply. We also provide free nail trims for established patients. Would you) Tj
T* (like me to schedule a meet-and-greet for you?") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Q: What's your pricing?**  ) Tj
T* (A: "Our pricing varies based on your pet's needs and the services required. Generally, wellness exams start at $89, routine) Tj
T* (procedures range from $45 to $299, and emergency visits begin at $149. We offer wellness plans and accept pet insurance.) Tj
T* (I'd be happy to discuss specific pricing for your pet's needs and schedule an appointment.") Tj
T* () Tj
