T* (- Description: 24/7 emergency water removal, structural drying, and moisture control services  ) Tj
T* (- Key Benefits: 30-minute response time, industrial-grade equipment, insurance coordination  ) Tj
T* (- Price: Emergency response from $400, complete water extraction from $1,200  ) Tj
T* (- Ideal for: Property owners dealing with flooding, burst pipes, or water damage emergencies) Tj
